{'symbol': 'LYB', 'date': '2022-03-08 12:43:00', 'title': 'LYONDELLBASELL TO ADDRESS J.P. MORGAN INDUSTRIALS CONFERENCE', 'text': 'HOUSTON\xa0AND\xa0LONDON, MARCH 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LYONDELLBASELL (NYSE: LYB), ONE OF THE LARGEST PLASTICS, CHEMICALS AND REFINING COMPANIES IN THE WORLD, TODAY ANNOUNCED KEN LANE, INTERIM CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT AT THE J.P. MORGAN INDUSTRIALS CONFERENCE ON WEDNESDAY, MARCH 16, 2022, AT 3:50 P.M.'}